WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.275 --> 00:00:13.703
- [Narrator] Clash of Clans
is a global phenomenon.

00:00:13.703 --> 00:00:15.340
This great big story took us to the edge

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:18.257
of Eastern Europe to meet this guy.

00:00:20.805 --> 00:00:21.888
- It's alive!

00:00:23.252 --> 00:00:25.135
- [Narrator] Vlad uses
clay to connect with others

00:00:25.135 --> 00:00:26.711
and thanks to the internet, his work

00:00:26.711 --> 00:00:30.211
reaches far beyond the borders of Estonia.

